  "description": "\u201cOn a given finite straight line to construct an equilateral triangle.\u201d\n\u2014 Euclid's Elements, BOOK I \u2022 PROP. 1 (G.17)\n\n00:00 1 \u00b7 GIVEN: given / A B /\n00:06 2 \u00b7 GOAL: equilateral_triangle(/ A B /) \u2192 \u27e8 A B C \u27e9\n00:10 3 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: circle(A, B) \u2192 ( A B )\n00:14 4 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: circle(B, A) \u2192 ( B A )\n00:19 5 \u00b7 INTERSECT: ( A B ) \u2229 ( B A ) \u2192 C\n00:21 6 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: segment(C, A) \u2192 / C A /, segment(C, B) \u2192 / C B /\n00:24 7 \u00b7 ASSERT: ( A B ) \u2192 / A C / = / A B /\n00:29 8 \u00b7 ASSERT: ( B A ) \u2192 / B C / = / B A /\n00:34 9 \u00b7 ASSERT: / C A / = / A B /, / B C / = / A B / \u2192 / C A / = / B C /\n00:41 10 \u00b7 \u2234: / C A / = / A B / = / B C / \u2192 \u27e8 A B C \u27e9\n\nGEOMETOR \u2022 G.17 \u2022 v5",
